# Testing Rules

## Host (JVM)

- Unit tests: `.\scripts\pns_gradlew.ps1 :app:testDebugUnitTest` (also via `pns_verify_toolchain.ps1 -RunTests`)
- Coverage floor: Kover verify (scoped fleet/DNG/bracket helpers) — see ADR-0007
- Detekt + Android Lint via toolchain verify

## Device (USB)

- No checked-in `androidTest/` UI tree — proof via ADB scripts
- Capture / DNG: `pns_photo_capture_verify` / `pns_capture_pipeline_verify`
- Chrome: `pns_chrome_ux_gate` (never parallel with capture on one serial)
- Always `adb shell am force-stop dev.pointandshoot` after sessions

## When to add tests

- Bug fixes: JVM regression test when practical
- CRITICAL lock areas: USB gate + `REG-*` row in `docs/AGENT_REGRESSION_MEMORY.md` same commit
- Doc-only / bootstrap process: host `pns_validate_bootstrap.ps1` is enough
